<title>USA: Kodak to buy Advanced Tech division.</title>
<headline>Kodak to buy Advanced Tech division.</headline>
<dateline>BOTHELL, Wash 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co said it signed a letter of intent with Advanced Technology Laboratories Inc to acquire Nova MicroSonics, ATL's digital image management division.</p>
<p>The agreement is subject to legal, regulatory and financial review.</p>
<p>The sales transaction is not expected to result in a material impact on either company. No other details were disclosed.</p>
